---------- Integration  ollama model -----------------

1. download ollama  using url

https://ollama.com/download/windows

2. open windows powershell and paste command line

irm https://ollama.com/install.ps1 | iex   // or download manually

3.Installation verification

ollama --version

4.model download

ollama pull deepseek-r1:14b

5.Server check

ollama list

ollama pull mistral  // download any model as per your need or whatever you have set in application properties

5.Set below properties in application.properties file

spring.ai.openai.chat.options.model=deepseek-r1:14b